window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A mysterious affliction, a collapsing world, and Elara’s fight to stop the darkness from rewriting existence</p> <p>Elara’s world shifts in subtle, unsettling ways. A mysterious illness creeps through her body, unraveling the fabric of her reality with every passing day. As shadows lengthen around her, the ordinary becomes uncanny, and those once familiar turn fearful, retreating from a contagion they cannot understand.</p> <p>Amid the growing isolation, Leo emerges. He’s a steadfast presence weaving between protection and curiosity. Bound by secrets neither fully grasps, they navigate a landscape where trust is fragile and the lines between healing and harm blur. Their intertwined destinies hinge on unlocking the enigma of Elara’s affliction before it consumes her entirely.</p> <p>Elara’s powers surge and change, wild and unpredictable, forcing her to embrace an uncertain destiny. At the heart of the chaos stands Viktor Kane, a corrupted figure harnessing dark aurora energy with a terrifying goal: to force a cataclysmic merging of worlds. The stakes are nothing less than existence itself as the fragile line between creation and destruction blurs.</p> <p>Time fractures, and with it, their fragile grip on hope. Elara fights not only her physical decline but the suspicion that twists the world against her. On the other hand, the confrontation with Kane is not just a fight for survival but a crucible where the true meaning of harmony and sacrifice is revealed.</p> <p>With every revelation, the stakes rise: Survival demands unraveling the truth before the ripples of her condition ruffle outward, threatening to engulf all she holds dear.</p> <p>In this world poised between reality and something altogether different, will Elara overcome the battle for healing as it slowly becomes a battle for life itself? Listen to the final book in the series, <i>Behind the Northern Veil: Into the Aurora</i>, to find out!</p>"; 
